Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:47.54,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:55.64,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:06:00.70,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:05.52,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:11.15,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:18.68,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.93,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:25.85,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:31.71,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:34.44,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:40.44,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:44.54,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:47.73,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:50.26,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don’t want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.50,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I’m just here to…
